{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Command. Conquer. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Conquest!</i> blends medieval warfare, real-time tactics, and player-driven diplomacy.<br>Wage real-time war in a world shaped by strategy, class, and conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Conquest!</i> is a free, real-time multiplayer strategy game set in a dynamic medieval fantasy world. Choose your class, forge alliances, and rise to power in a living realm that evolves with every decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd9 10 Unique Classes</strong> \u2014 Each with distinct strengths, spells, and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Persistent World</strong> \u2014 Ages last 15\u201330 days; influence the map and history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Alliance Warfare</strong> \u2014 Coordinate, conquer, and dominate as a team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Depth Without Grind</strong> \u2014 Strategic depth without tedious micromanagement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Accessible but Competitive</strong> \u2014 Easy to learn, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>No Ads. No Pay-to-Win</strong> \u2014 Just fair, strategic fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a veteran warlord or a new tactician, <i>Conquest!</i> offers deep, strategic gameplay in a fast-paced, modern format.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771260/extras/Promotion.png?t=1748610889\" /> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Admiral","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1771260/42cc56ad0a9902e30fb2594c2399335c0b83dad0.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akama